Tafsiri ya Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:216</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَإِنْ عَصَوْكَ فَقُلْ إِنِّي بَرِيءٌ مِّمَّا تَعْمَلُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Na ikiwa watakuasi basi sema: Mimi najitenga mbali na hayo mnayo yatenda.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإنه بريء من معاصي أصحابه وإن تابوا منها.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/543</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s26a216\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/26-213.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (26:213)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/26-217.html\">Aya inayofuata (26:217)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/26-217.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:217 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na umtegemee Mtukufu Mwenye nguvu Mwenye kurehemu.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/26-217.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-217.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-217.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/26-217.html\">\