ُكُمْ عَلَىٰ مَن تَنَزَّلُ الشَّيَاطِينُ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Je! Nikwambieni nani wanawashukia Mashet&#x27;ani?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><h3>Aliyoyanukuu kutoka kwa wengine</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن عمر أو ابن عباس (في المختار بن أبي عبيد)</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «وقيل للآخر: إنه يقول إنه ينزل عليه فقال {هل أنبئكم على من تنزل الشياطين}»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 13/75</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s26a221\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/26-217.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (26:217)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/26-222.html\">Aya inayofuata (26:222)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/26-222.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:222 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Wanamshukia kila mzushi mkubwa mwingi wa dhambi.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/26-222.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-222.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-222.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en